Delete a metric

Usage: vendo metrics delete [OPTIONS] <metricId>

Arguments:
  <metricId>  

Options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
  -y, --yes             Skip confirmation
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
      --json            Output raw JSON
  -h, --help            Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo metrics delete <metricId>
  $ vendo metrics delete <metricId> -y
